{title: Mast Baharon Ka Main Aashiq}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Mast baharon ka main aashiq,        Main jo chaahe [Gm]yaar karoon
[Gm]Chaahe gulon ke saaye se kheloon,        [C]Chaahe kali se [F]pyaar karoon
[F]Sara [C]jahan hai,        [A#]mere liye, [A]mere [Dm]liye
[Dm]Main hoon woh [Gm]deewana,        [C]Jiske sab deewane [Dm]ha
[Dm]Kisko hai za [Gm]roorat,        [C]Teri aye zamane [Dm]ha
[A#]Mera apna [A]rasta,        [A#]duniya se kya [A]vasta
[Dm]Mere dil mein tamannaon [F]ki,        [F]Duniya [C]jawan hai
[A#]mere liye, [A]mere [Dm]liye,        [Dm]Meri aankhon [Gm]se zara
[C]aankhein to mila de [Dm]ha,        [Dm]Meri raahein [Gm]rok le
[C]nazrein to bichha de [Dm]ha,        [A#]Tere sar ki [A]hai kasam
[A#]Main jo chala [A]gaya sanam,        [Dm]To yeh rut bhi chali [F]jaayegi
[F]Yeh to [C]yahan,        [A#]mere liye, [A]mere [Dm]liye
[Dm]Sabko yeh [Gm]bata do,        [C]keh do har nazar se [Dm]ha
[Dm]Koi bhi [Gm]mere siwa,        [C]guzre na idhar se [Dm]ha
[A#]Batla do [A]jahan ko,        [A#]samjha do [A]kiza ko
[Dm]Aaye jaaye yahan na [F]koi,        [F]Yeh guli [C]stan hai
[A#]mere liye, [A]mere [Dm]liye
